<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Hortors listing to be terminated Friday.</title>
<headline>Hortors listing to be terminated Friday.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>CTP Holdings Ltd said on Friday it had compulsorily acquired from Hortors shareholders the ordinary shares which it had not acquired in a previous offer dated October 4.</p>
<p>In that offer CTP had offered Hortors shareholders one new CTP share for every 10 Hortors shares held.</p>
<p>Accordingly, the listing of Hortors on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange will be terminated at the close of trade on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
